+EPISODES SETUP (decision 461.1, one time; Akshay finalised the release dates on 4 Nov). SETUP PREVIEW: list the Episodes at Work started by Planned release, earliest first, marking the 6 to keep and the rest to move back to Scheduled (an Episode at Work started with no Planned release: listed last, moved back); write only the run record, with the list, and change no row. SETUP: the same list, then set Status Scheduled on each Episode after the first 6, Planned release unchanged, and log one Activity per moved Episode, Kind Note, Summary "Setup: <Episode> back to Scheduled (decision 461)", Episode linked; read each back; a run record line per Episode. A run that finds an earlier "Setup:" Activity does nothing and says so. Neither mode sends anything.
